#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_oca.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_health_oop_claim
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_oca.field_hr_version__l10n_sk_health_oop_claim
msgid ""
"Claim the health-insurance deductible allowance (OOP) for low earners in a "
"regular employment relationship. It reduces ONLY the employee's health "
"assessment base: max 380 €/mo, phased out by 2 € of base per 1 € of income "
"above 380 €, reaching 0 at 570 €. Must be claimed in writing; it does not "
"apply to an agreement."
msgstr ""

#. module: l10n_sk_hr_payroll_oca
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_oca.field_hr_employee__l10n_sk_agreement_oop
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_sk_hr_payroll_oca.field_hr_version__l10n_sk_agreement_oop
msgid ""
"Claim the pension deductible allowance (OOP) on an agreement for an eligible"
" pensioner or student. It reduces the assessment base for old-age, "
"disability and the reserve fund by up to 200 €/month. Only one such "
"agreement per month may claim it."
msgstr ""

